# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Docker build context exclusions.
#
#  Two rules govern this file:
#    1. SECRETS must never enter the build context.  (.env / .env.* below)
#    2. MUTABLE RUNTIME STATE must never be baked into the image. An image is
#       immutable; `data/` is not. It is bind-mounted at run time (see
#       docker-compose.yml). Baking it in means every rebuild silently resets
#       paper-trading history, open positions and forward-test evidence — the
#       very records this platform exists to accumulate.
#
#  Guarded by test/docker-context.test.js, which recomputes the build context and
#  asserts on it. Do not edit this file without running `npm test`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── secrets (never in an image layer; supplied at runtime via env_file) ───────
.env
.env.*

# ── vcs / tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# ── mutable runtime state — bind-mounted, never copied ───────────────────────
# data/config-overrides.json carries STRANGLE_ENGINE_ENABLED, STRANGLE_CAPITAL and
# AI_AGENTS_ENABLED. A container started from a baked snapshot would run with a
# stale engine configuration and a stale ledger.
data

# ── research datasets — bind-mounted read-only, never copied (187 MB) ─────────
bt-data
backtest-tv-results-*.json
exports

# ── migration backups: source snapshots, no place in an image ────────────────
backups

# ── docs, screenshots, UI experiments ────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
docs
SCREEENSHOTS
_shot-*.png
design-candidates
terminal-candidates
public/designs
public/terminals

# ── tests and backtest CLIs are not part of the runtime image ───────────────
test
backtest-real
backtest-tv

# ── archived / non-Node trees ────────────────────────────────────────────────
deprecated
stock
antigravity-py

# Research corpora are not runtime inputs. market-data/ appeared 2026-08-12 and
# holds india_stock_master in three formats (11.2 MB json + 2.8 MB csv + 2.6 MB
# xlsx). Nothing in the codebase reads any of them, and the image is not where a
# dataset belongs — test/docker-context.test.js caps a single context file at
# 5 MB for exactly this reason.
#
# Deliberately NOT added to .gitignore: whether a stock master should be version
# controlled is the owner's call, not a side effect of a docker fix.
market-data
